This project invokes external command-line tools which carry their own
licenses:

  - smpl-extract (https://github.com/DriftwoodAudio/smpl-extract)
  - libgig / akaiextract (http://www.linuxsampler.org/libgig/) - GPL

These tools are separate works, are not distributed with this software, and
are only invoked as external programs. Users must comply with their respective
licenses.

This repository contains no disc images and no extracted audio samples.
Sample libraries remain the property of their original publishers.
